@@ -0,0 +1,378 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
+/*
+ * Variscite VAR-MX7CustomBoard carrier board for VAR-SOM-MX7
+ *
+ * Link: https://variscite.com/carrier-boards/var-mx7customboard/
