Add a devicetree for the Motorola One smartphone, which is based
on the Jacala/MSM8953 SoC.

Supported functionality as of this initial submission:
* I2C peripherals (NFC)
* Power Button, Volume Keys
* Regulators (PM8953)
* Remoteprocs (ADSP, MPSS, WCNSS)
